 14. Saga + CQRS (Advanced)

- Command side → Saga controls workflow
- Query side → Eventually consistent read models

Perfect for high-scale systems

---

 15. How to Explain Saga in Interviews (Template)

> “Saga is a pattern for managing distributed transactions in microservices using a sequence of local transactions coordinated either by events or an orchestrator, with compensating actions to handle failures, ensuring eventual consistency without 2PC.”

